<Slide style={{ padding: '20px 60px', background: '#F7F4EC' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>第 11 章 · 手机上也能用</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.62)', marginTop: 6 }}>同一套代码覆盖手机、平板、笔电、桌面与超宽屏；窄屏时侧栏折成顶部条，导航进抽屉</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, padding: '9px 16px', background: '#1D1B16', borderRadius: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B8730F' }}>390px 宽度实测</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 460, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 470, height: 460, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Image src="assets/18_phone.png" style={{ width: 470, height: 460, borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)' }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 668, height: 460, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
                <Box style={{ height: 214, padding: 20, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16' }}>① 折行发生在 900px</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.72)', lineHeight: 1.62, marginTop: 10 }}>宽于 900px 时，左侧是一条竖向导航栏；窄于 900px 时，它自动折成页面顶部的横条，并把七个入口收进右侧抽屉，不占内容区。</Text>
                    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '9px 12px', background: 'rgba(228,220,203,0.75)', borderRadius: 7 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.80)' }}>布局切换无横向滚动条</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 214, padding: 20, background: 'rgba(184,115,15,0.10)', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid rgba(184,115,15,0.40)', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8A5608' }}>② 手机上能做完整个闭环</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.78)', lineHeight: 1.62, marginTop: 10 }}>上传数据、发起诊断、盯运行进度、读报告、看历史 —— 全部可用。产线上巡检时掏出手机就能确认昨晚那批料的结论，不用回办公室。</Text>
                    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '9px 12px', background: 'rgba(184,115,15,0.20)', borderRadius: 7 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8A5608' }}>报表型 HTML 在手机上也自适应</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 60, padding: 16, background: '#1D1B16', borderRadius: 10, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F0A93B' }}>注意</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(247,244,236,0.84)' }}>窄屏下表格会保留列语义但压缩内边距，长文本以省略号截断，鼠标悬停可看全文 —— 不会出现错位或遮挡。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.45)' }}>手机访问用电脑的局域网 IP 即可，端口仍是 5180</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.45)' }}>29 / 31</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
